        "original_id": "cd33a790-5a5e-5ba5-8c13-46789e2942d6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Dubai Media City, Dubai, United Arab Emirates, New York City\n- Buildings: Business Central Towers, Chrysler Building, Empire State Building\n\nFacts:\n- Business Central Towers is a complex of two 53-floor towers in Dubai Media City in Dubai, United Arab Emirates.\n- Both Business Central Towers have the same structural height of 265 m.\n- Business Central Towers resemble New York City's Chrysler Building.\n- In 1931, the Empire State Building surpassed the Chrysler Building after the Chrysler Building had been the world's tallest building for 11 months.\n- The Chrysler Building is 318.9 m tall.",
